Step 9 — Add New Chat

Add:

newChat(): void {

  if (this.isStreaming) {
    return;
  }

  this.conversationId = null;

  this.messages = [];
}

That's all.

Do not call the backend to create a conversation yet.

Remember our design:

New Chat clicked
      ↓
conversationId = null

User types:
"Hello"
      ↓
POST /api/chat/stream

{
   message: "Hello",
   conversation_id: null
}

      ↓

ConversationService
      ↓
creates new UUID
      ↓
start event returns conversation_id

So clicking New Chat itself does not create an empty DB conversation.

That's desirable.

